    "Negotiated ordered business target sets with exact per-rule/protocol authorization, fallback/RR/random and bounded failure/recovery observations",
    "Fixed UDP source mappings retarget sockets without resetting AEAD sequence or replay state; bounded closed-session wire history across policy reloads",
    "Bounded auxiliary TCP probe workers, no-probe TCP half-open recovery, and secret-free digest-bound target status"
